.TH "RAPTOR-REPORT" 1 "2026-10" "RAPTOR Studio" "RAPTOR Studio Manual"
.SH NAME
raptor\-report \- Print a report of an earlier run kept with 'raptor run \-\-workspace DIR' (the run id is in the JSON output and on stderr).
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBraptor report\fR [\-h] \-\-workspace DIR [\-r NAME] [\-f {text,json}] RUN\-ID
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print a report of an earlier run kept with 'raptor run \-\-workspace DIR' (the run id is in the JSON output and on stderr).
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Options
.TP
\fB\-\-workspace\fR \fIDIR\fR

.TP
\fB\-r\fR, \fB\-\-report\fR \fINAME\fR
final, end\-of\-run, events, ao\-plot, capacity\-plot, interim\-cost (default final)
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR \fI{text|json}\fR

.SH SEE ALSO
\fBraptor\fR(1)
